WEBVTT

00:02.190 --> 00:03.230
Mother...

00:03.560 --> 00:05.730
In the sunflower fields of Spain...

00:06.060 --> 00:08.650
Kennosuke told me his future dream...

00:08.980 --> 00:11.360
And, it touched me deeply.

00:12.450 --> 00:14.490
Mother, when you were a child...

00:14.660 --> 00:16.530
what kind of dream did you have?

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
NAAJA

00:26.420 --> 00:27.710
Nadja,

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
With your eyes

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
Nadja,

00:30.380 --> 00:31.590
NAAJA

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
What do you see?

00:31.630 --> 00:33.880
Nani ga mieru

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Shining in the far distance,

00:33.930 --> 00:36.800
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
The door to the future,

00:36.800 --> 00:39.180
Mirai no tobira

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
That's what I'm searching for

00:40.100 --> 00:43.560
Sagashite iru

00:43.560 --> 00:50.780
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:51.480 --> 00:54.990
Minna egao de aetara

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:55.070 --> 00:58.320
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
It could be so much more fun

00:58.370 --> 01:01.580
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:01.620 --> 01:05.040
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
I can't see the end of the journey

01:05.420 --> 01:08.710
Tabi no owari wa mienai

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
God is the only one who could possibly know

01:08.840 --> 01:12.170
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:12.340 --> 01:15.930
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
I will go waving

01:15.970 --> 01:18.090
Te wo furinagara

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:18.180 --> 01:24.850
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
But I won't look back

01:24.890 --> 01:27.600
Ushiro mukanai

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Until the day my dream comes true

01:27.940 --> 01:32.900
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
Nadja, Your smile

01:33.190 --> 01:36.610
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
Nadja, gives me courage

01:36.700 --> 01:40.030
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Under the blue sky,

01:40.070 --> 01:42.990
Aoi sora no shita de

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
I will find the place

01:43.120 --> 01:45.960
Ashita no yukue

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
where my future lies

01:46.250 --> 01:50.170
Mitsukeru kara

01:59.640 --> 02:03.970
Gonzales Mansion

02:04.600 --> 02:09.310
Above a quiet forest

02:09.520 --> 02:14.320
a single shining star,

02:14.820 --> 02:19.610
sings a song of love.

02:30.600 --> 02:33.230
﻿Good morning, Princess Rosemary.

02:38.510 --> 02:43.550
The Dangerous Princess

02:47.580 --> 02:49.710
﻿Now then! What you've been waiting for!

02:49.830 --> 02:54.750
﻿The heavenly and miraculous dancing princess Nadja will dance the flamenco!

03:34.210 --> 03:35.330
﻿Nadja...!

04:01.740 --> 04:03.450
﻿Nadja!

04:04.610 --> 04:06.120
﻿I knew it was you, Nadja!

04:07.200 --> 04:08.030
Rosemary!

04:08.790 --> 04:10.490
﻿Rosemary! Nadja!

04:12.690 --> 04:18.270
Let's pick them up... one, and two, and... You're out already?

04:15.670 --> 04:18.270
﻿Apparently, that girl was with Nadja at the Applefield orphanage...

04:19.960 --> 04:21.840
﻿She's quite beautiful!

04:23.680 --> 04:25.970
﻿Eh? Then Oliver is in Paris..

04:26.450 --> 04:26.950
Yup!

04:27.550 --> 04:30.600
﻿He's working hard to become a master saddle-maker.

04:32.930 --> 04:33.480
I see.

04:34.060 --> 04:36.900
I guess everything's changed from back in the old days...

04:37.150 --> 04:38.730
﻿Th-That's not true!

04:39.020 --> 04:41.150
﻿Oliver and you, Rosemary..

04:41.570 --> 04:45.070
﻿Haven't changed a single bit since we were at Applefield's.

04:45.450 --> 04:48.740
﻿But, now, you're a dancer in an traveling troupe...

04:48.870 --> 04:51.120
﻿and I'm a maid on an aristocrat's estate.

04:51.870 --> 04:53.950
﻿The only thing that hasn't changed are those clothes.

04:54.410 --> 04:55.620
﻿It reminds me of the old days...

04:56.540 --> 04:58.500
I ﻿didn't think you'd still be wearing them.

04:59.670 --> 05:01.590
﻿That's because these clothes...

05:01.960 --> 05:06.550
﻿have all of those precious memories of Applefield packed in them.

05:08.760 --> 05:10.430
﻿Applefield, huh...

05:11.890 --> 05:13.390
﻿Back then, you were...

05:19.900 --> 05:22.070
﻿I'm Princess Rosemary!

05:22.360 --> 05:24.530
﻿I'm really a princess.

05:24.780 --> 05:28.530
﻿That's why a prince from a castle is coming for me soon.

05:28.990 --> 05:30.490
﻿Princess Rosemary.

05:30.990 --> 05:33.240
﻿I am your faithful knight.

05:33.750 --> 05:37.120
﻿I will protect you until the prince comes for you.

05:39.460 --> 05:41.130
﻿Thank you, Nadja.

05:41.590 --> 05:46.470
﻿So, please reward me with lots of cakes where you go to the castle.

05:46.860 --> 05:47.780
Of course.

05:47.990 --> 05:49.410
Nadja!

05:50.100 --> 05:51.720
﻿Let's climb trees!

05:51.970 --> 05:52.850
﻿Okay!

05:53.720 --> 05:55.020
﻿Come on, Rosemary.

05:57.230 --> 05:59.850
A ﻿princess doesn't climb trees.

06:00.020 --> 06:01.310
﻿Oh, right.

06:02.270 --> 06:07.150
﻿Then, please watch and see how well your knight can climb.

06:07.740 --> 06:08.990
﻿That'll be okay.

06:11.160 --> 06:13.410
﻿Oh, that reminds me. Do you still remember, Rosemary?

06:13.660 --> 06:14.950
﻿Huh? Remember what?

06:16.830 --> 06:18.080
﻿I did it!

06:18.370 --> 06:20.460
﻿Nadja wins again..

06:20.790 --> 06:22.880
﻿Congratulations, my knight!

06:23.210 --> 06:25.340
﻿Thank you Princess Rosemary!

06:29.380 --> 06:31.010
﻿Princess my butt!

06:31.340 --> 06:33.140
﻿No matter how long you wait...

06:33.140 --> 06:35.890
﻿No way a prince is going to come to a place like this.

06:55.700 --> 06:56.790
﻿What are you doing?

06:56.910 --> 06:57.870
﻿Rosemary.

06:58.710 --> 07:02.420
﻿If I stay here, my prince will never find me.

07:02.750 --> 07:03.500
﻿That's why...

07:03.840 --> 07:04.960
﻿Rosemary...

07:05.460 --> 07:06.630
﻿Are you still asleep?

07:20.560 --> 07:21.560
﻿Nadja?

07:23.730 --> 07:25.770
﻿Ah, Princess Rosemary.

07:26.190 --> 07:28.070
﻿When your prince comes...

07:28.230 --> 07:29.780
﻿and you are not here...

07:30.070 --> 07:32.030
﻿your knight will get in trouble for it.

07:32.910 --> 07:35.030
﻿So, please, don't go.

07:38.410 --> 07:39.580
﻿Nadja...

07:43.500 --> 07:46.040
﻿I was really surprised that time...

07:47.050 --> 07:48.920
﻿If you hadn't stopped me...

07:49.420 --> 07:51.590
﻿I wonder what would have happened to me...

07:54.010 --> 07:56.140
﻿You were always on my side..

07:57.260 --> 07:58.930
﻿...my faithful knight.

08:00.680 --> 08:04.270
﻿Sometimes, I feel homesick for Applefield.

08:05.020 --> 08:06.730
﻿But, my work is dancing which I love...

08:07.320 --> 08:09.480
﻿and everyone in the troupe is really nice.

08:10.400 --> 08:13.320
﻿And if I keep traveling all over the world...

08:13.570 --> 08:16.620
I ﻿keep believing that someday I'll meet my mother.

08:17.080 --> 08:19.240
﻿I see. I hope you'll meet her someday.

08:21.500 --> 08:23.080
﻿Poor Nadja.

08:23.670 --> 08:26.130
﻿There's not a chance that'll happen.

08:27.340 --> 08:28.790
Hey, Rosemary...

08:30.010 --> 08:31.920
﻿Working for a large estate...

08:32.130 --> 08:33.590
﻿isn't that hard work?

08:33.840 --> 08:37.760
Oh, no. The master and mistress have taken a liking to me...

08:37.930 --> 08:39.760
﻿and they're very good to me.

08:39.970 --> 08:41.560
﻿The young master is very kind as well.

08:41.770 --> 08:42.890
I'm ﻿happy for you.

08:43.390 --> 08:45.350
﻿It's true that it's a lot of work...

08:45.730 --> 08:47.350
﻿but, I'm learning a lot.

08:47.980 --> 08:53.070
﻿Like how to behave in upper society. I'm sure it'll be useful some day.

08:58.200 --> 09:02.330
﻿For the day when your prince can come for you, correct?

09:02.910 --> 09:04.330
﻿Princess Rosemary.

09:05.330 --> 09:09.000
﻿That's right, my faithful knight... Nadja.

09:14.510 --> 09:15.590
﻿Ah! Oh, no!

09:17.430 --> 09:19.890
﻿Hey! Which estate are you working at?

09:20.140 --> 09:21.430
I'll come again!

09:26.190 --> 09:28.560
﻿Rosemary, you useless child!

09:29.060 --> 09:30.270
﻿I'm very sorry.

09:30.900 --> 09:32.070
Leave that...

09:32.320 --> 09:33.780
﻿and, go do some ironing.

09:38.110 --> 09:40.160
﻿What a strange child..

09:40.490 --> 09:44.370
﻿When she first got here, she was always crying.

09:44.700 --> 09:47.290
﻿Just when she finally stopped doing that...

09:47.710 --> 09:51.590
﻿I found her in the attic singing songs by herself all happily.

09:51.710 --> 09:53.630
﻿You heard her, too?

09:58.550 --> 10:00.470
﻿Young Master Fernando has returned.

10:00.640 --> 10:01.470
﻿Yes, ma'am.

10:06.230 --> 10:08.520
﻿How are the preparations for tomorrow's birthday party?

10:09.020 --> 10:09.520
﻿Yes, sir.

10:10.060 --> 10:11.690
﻿Everything has been prepared.

10:13.020 --> 10:13.860
﻿I see.

10:14.570 --> 10:15.610
﻿Master Fernando.

10:16.320 --> 10:17.740
﻿I've brought your water.

10:20.240 --> 10:20.950
﻿It's not cold!

10:21.070 --> 10:23.740
﻿Ah! I'm sorry, I'll bring another glass immediately.

10:30.380 --> 10:32.290
﻿I-I'm sorry.

10:33.750 --> 10:34.880
﻿Are you all right?

10:36.210 --> 10:37.130
﻿Yes.

10:40.470 --> 10:42.220
﻿Hey, what are you looking at?

10:43.050 --> 10:44.050
﻿Be careful.

10:56.110 --> 10:57.190
﻿Dear Ms. Appleton...

10:57.740 --> 10:59.570
﻿Something wonderful happened today.

11:00.410 --> 11:03.240
﻿I ran into Rosemary in Granada.

11:04.200 --> 11:07.200
﻿She told me she is being well taken care of on the estate where she works...

11:07.200 --> 11:08.870
﻿and, she seemed very happy.

11:12.710 --> 11:13.710
﻿Rosemary...

11:14.630 --> 11:16.630
﻿I wonder if she'll come see me again tomorrow...?

11:24.260 --> 11:25.720
﻿Poor Nadja.

11:26.430 --> 11:28.640
﻿There's no way she's going to find her mother.

11:29.180 --> 11:31.560
﻿She's going to spend the rest of her life...

11:31.730 --> 11:34.480
﻿dancing in that traveling troupe.

11:37.190 --> 11:39.530
I ﻿am Princess Rosemary.

11:40.820 --> 11:44.820
﻿I'm sure that my prince is coming from the castle for me tomorrow.

11:49.430 --> 11:50.310
Nadja!

11:51.750 --> 11:52.870
﻿Rosemary!

11:54.330 --> 11:56.420
﻿Huh? This much?

11:57.460 --> 11:59.960
﻿Mistress insisted that I bring it all to you.

12:00.550 --> 12:03.550
﻿Because, I'm her favorite maid, see?

12:08.260 --> 12:09.180
﻿That is...!

12:10.100 --> 12:13.690
﻿While you're here, I want to help you as much as I can.

12:14.150 --> 12:15.270
﻿Thank you.

12:15.270 --> 12:16.980
﻿But... are you sure this is okay?

12:17.130 --> 12:17.590
Yes.

12:18.230 --> 12:20.280
﻿Yo! If it isn't you Nadja!

12:20.690 --> 12:22.900
﻿What a coincidence that we should meet in Granada.

12:23.240 --> 12:24.570
﻿Master Fernando!

12:25.660 --> 12:26.620
﻿Master?

12:27.780 --> 12:30.200
﻿You! What are you doing here?!

12:30.910 --> 12:34.290
﻿You mean... the estate where Rosemary is working belongs to...

12:55.770 --> 12:58.520
﻿Quit slacking off, and get back to work!

12:58.730 --> 13:01.400
﻿Or, I'll tell my mother.

13:01.400 --> 13:03.190
﻿I-I'm very sorry!

13:03.610 --> 13:04.860
﻿Hurry up and go home!

13:05.150 --> 13:05.650
﻿Yes.

13:07.990 --> 13:08.990
﻿Rosemary...

13:09.910 --> 13:12.700
﻿That maid of ours is really stupid.

13:13.370 --> 13:14.410
﻿Rosemary is...

13:14.750 --> 13:17.080
﻿Working at your estate?

13:17.460 --> 13:21.750
﻿Hmm? She's named Rosemary?

13:28.010 --> 13:30.850
﻿I wonder if Master Fernando has realized...

13:31.810 --> 13:35.020
﻿that I'm really a Princess.

13:39.110 --> 13:41.520
﻿I didn't know you were in Granada.

13:42.780 --> 13:43.440
That!

13:43.990 --> 13:47.450
﻿That maid must have stolen it from our kitchen!

13:47.910 --> 13:49.070
﻿She didn't steal it!

13:49.370 --> 13:51.280
Rosemary would never do that!

13:52.200 --> 13:53.990
﻿She said her Mistress gave them to her.

13:54.290 --> 13:55.700
﻿Mother did?

13:57.370 --> 14:01.040
﻿There's no way that mother would give such expensive to a maid.

14:02.670 --> 14:04.130
﻿Then this is...

14:04.880 --> 14:06.920
﻿Well, it's all right. Keep it.

14:07.180 --> 14:09.930
﻿We aristocrats have very big hearts.

14:10.140 --> 14:11.300
﻿No! I'm returning this to you!

14:12.470 --> 14:13.760
Don't be stubborn. Keep it.

14:13.930 --> 14:14.970
﻿I don't want it!

14:15.140 --> 14:15.810
﻿Keep it!

14:15.890 --> 14:16.980
﻿I don't want it!!

14:17.140 --> 14:17.730
﻿Keep it!!

14:17.980 --> 14:18.940
﻿I said I don't want it!!

14:21.560 --> 14:27.360
﻿Well, I guess plebeians like you wouldn't understand the taste of such expensive things.

14:28.200 --> 14:28.780
﻿I know!

14:28.910 --> 14:33.740
﻿Nadja, I'll let you see how real aristocrats live!

14:36.290 --> 14:40.040
﻿Tonight we're having a birthday party at my estate.

14:40.290 --> 14:41.250
﻿I'm inviting you.

14:41.380 --> 14:43.250
﻿Huh N-No, thank you.

14:43.840 --> 14:45.960
I'm ﻿trying to be nice to you!

14:48.170 --> 14:50.470
Was that maid﻿ a friend of yours?

14:51.410 --> 14:52.030
Yes.

14:52.550 --> 14:54.850
﻿She was at Applefield with me...

14:55.640 --> 14:57.100
﻿she's a precious friend of mine.

14:57.270 --> 14:59.890
﻿If you don't come, maybe I'll..

15:00.140 --> 15:01.650
﻿fire your friend.

15:01.900 --> 15:03.150
﻿What? How could you!

15:04.650 --> 15:09.320
﻿The master can treat his servants any way he wants.

15:11.110 --> 15:12.700
﻿Fernando Gonzales?

15:13.200 --> 15:14.030
﻿Who was that again?

15:14.280 --> 15:15.870
﻿Ah! It's that guy!

15:16.200 --> 15:18.950
When I was almost ran over by a car in Paris...

15:19.120 --> 15:21.290
﻿he got really mad.

15:21.420 --> 15:25.000
﻿You don't have to go to a birthday party for a guy like that!

15:25.340 --> 15:28.760
﻿But if I don't go, Rosemary will be fired.

15:30.930 --> 15:31.510
﻿And...

15:32.430 --> 15:36.430
﻿The master and mistress have taken a liking to me...

15:36.560 --> 15:38.430
﻿and, they're very good to me.

15:38.720 --> 15:40.560
﻿The young master is very kind as well.

15:41.480 --> 15:43.100
﻿For her to say a lie as big as that to me...

15:43.560 --> 15:44.600
﻿I'm worried....

15:45.860 --> 15:47.150
I'﻿m going, after all!

15:50.360 --> 15:53.070
﻿Do what you need to do, Nadja.

15:58.740 --> 16:01.910
﻿I have to see Rosemary and get her to tell me the truth behind all of this.

16:02.750 --> 16:04.420
﻿Hey, Little Rosebud!

16:06.380 --> 16:07.340
﻿Hello.

16:07.630 --> 16:09.170
﻿Leonardo and Thierry!

16:09.510 --> 16:11.720
﻿We sure run into each other a lot...

16:11.880 --> 16:13.010
﻿Little Rosebud.

16:13.300 --> 16:14.340
﻿It's Nadja.

16:14.800 --> 16:16.390
We keep meeting so often...

16:16.600 --> 16:20.560
﻿We must be tied together by the red thread of fate.

16:20.980 --> 16:21.730
﻿That's right.

16:23.390 --> 16:27.560
﻿Those two, maybe they're really hardcore groupies of the Dandelion Troupe.

16:27.900 --> 16:28.770
﻿Not a chance.

16:29.070 --> 16:30.110
﻿Actually, we...

16:30.360 --> 16:34.070
﻿were invited to a birthday party for one of our favorite customer's son, Fernando

16:34.490 --> 16:36.280
﻿Huh? I was, too!

16:36.620 --> 16:37.280
﻿You, too?

16:38.030 --> 16:39.620
﻿Though, I don't really want to go...

16:39.950 --> 16:43.460
﻿But if I don't, my friend may be fired from her maid's job.

16:43.830 --> 16:45.540
﻿I don't know the details, but...

16:46.080 --> 16:50.460
﻿It seems that Fernando is making causing for my Little Rosebud.

16:50.880 --> 16:54.010
﻿But, you won't be able to go to the party in that dress.

16:56.470 --> 16:58.550
﻿Then, I'll go through the back door!

16:58.640 --> 16:59.800
﻿No, no!

16:59.810 --> 17:02.640
﻿If you enter through the back, it won't count as having attended.

17:02.810 --> 17:04.480
﻿Then I'll enter via the front.

17:05.270 --> 17:06.940
﻿You can't go in the front in those clothes...

17:07.770 --> 17:10.690
﻿You're more stubborn than you look, Little Rosebud.

17:34.590 --> 17:38.130
﻿Hello, Duke Belmonte. Thank you for coming.

17:38.550 --> 17:40.850
﻿Happy birthday, Fernando.

17:41.560 --> 17:42.470
﻿Thank you.

17:42.970 --> 17:44.430
﻿Are there enough drinks?

17:45.520 --> 17:47.230
﻿Hurry and carry out that dish.

17:48.980 --> 17:51.020
﻿There's so much wonderful food.

17:51.820 --> 17:53.070
﻿If there are leftovers...

17:53.780 --> 17:55.570
﻿I'll take some to Nadja. again.

17:56.360 --> 17:59.700
To ﻿my faithful knight, Nadja...

18:03.660 --> 18:05.120
﻿May I have your hand, my lady?

18:05.370 --> 18:05.950
﻿Yes...

18:24.560 --> 18:26.140
﻿Young Master Fernando.

18:27.020 --> 18:28.980
﻿He really knows the truth...

18:29.400 --> 18:31.610
﻿that I'm not just a maid.

18:32.820 --> 18:34.570
﻿But, you're not the one for me...

18:35.190 --> 18:38.900
﻿Because, a princess needs a prince.

18:43.910 --> 18:45.040
﻿Rosemary.

18:47.830 --> 18:49.410
﻿Stop staring...

18:49.500 --> 18:51.500
﻿and start serving the drinks to our guests.

18:52.920 --> 18:54.420
﻿Yes, right away.

19:01.890 --> 19:03.600
﻿What a beautiful young lady...

19:03.890 --> 19:05.640
﻿Which family's daughter is she, I wonder?

19:09.730 --> 19:11.310
H﻿appy birthday.

19:11.520 --> 19:12.730
﻿Thank you for the invitation.

19:18.780 --> 19:20.110
﻿Na-Nadja...!

19:25.950 --> 19:27.700
﻿W-Welcome, Nadja.

19:36.460 --> 19:37.710
﻿I came just as promised.

19:38.050 --> 19:40.670
﻿So, please don't fire Rosemary.

19:42.760 --> 19:44.470
﻿What a beautiful young lady.

19:45.050 --> 19:47.390
﻿I'm not a lady.

19:47.890 --> 19:52.020
I'﻿m a dancer for the Dandelion Troupe, Nadja Applefield.

19:54.190 --> 19:55.360
﻿A traveling entertainer, huh?

19:55.860 --> 19:58.230
﻿What an honest Little Rosebud you are!

19:58.780 --> 20:02.860
﻿Before your beauty, both money and social status are worth less than a grain of sand.

20:04.820 --> 20:07.580
Excuse me, where is Rosemary who works here?

20:08.080 --> 20:09.290
I'm sorry, I don't know.

20:12.330 --> 20:13.210
﻿Nadja...

20:13.460 --> 20:16.130
﻿You were supposed to be my faithful knight.

20:16.590 --> 20:20.000
﻿But, you were acting like a princess!

20:21.550 --> 20:24.090
﻿Rosemary, where are you?

20:27.390 --> 20:29.810
I ﻿am... I am the princess

20:30.060 --> 20:31.980
﻿I am Princess Rosemary!

20:35.650 --> 20:36.650
﻿U-Umm..

20:37.190 --> 20:38.270
﻿Where is Rosemary?

20:38.270 --> 20:39.940
﻿Ah! I'm sorry miss.

20:40.190 --> 20:43.320
﻿Guests should not be here.

20:43.530 --> 20:45.410
﻿I'm not a "miss".

20:45.610 --> 20:47.740
﻿I'm looking for my friend, Rosemary.

20:47.740 --> 20:49.830
﻿We will be the ones to get in trouble for it, so please...

20:51.750 --> 20:52.540
﻿That's right.

20:52.790 --> 20:55.040
﻿I'm Princess Rosemary.

20:55.620 --> 20:58.960
﻿Tomorrow, my prince will surely come for me.

21:00.800 --> 21:03.170
﻿Fernando, blow out the candles.

21:25.740 --> 21:27.360
﻿Princess Rosemary.

21:34.290 --> 21:37.170
